---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../site";
---

<Base title="About" description={SITE.description}>
  <article>
    <div class="center"><h1 class="title">About</h1></div>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <p>
      I'm a data scientist in Seattle. I've spent ten years working out why numbers move in games and retail,
      and building the models, pipelines and dashboards that let teams act on it.
    </p>
    <p>
      Since mid-2026 I've been building human-in-the-loop AI systems: coding agents that work from a ticket
      board and stop at review, self-hosted image and voice models on my own GPU server, and evaluations that
      decide when a model is good enough to use.
    </p>
    <p>I'm open to remote contracts of 6 to 12 weeks in analytics, data science or applied AI.</p>
    <p>See my <a href="/experience">experience</a> for where I've worked.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
